        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Bargee, Rhubarb\n- People: Duncan Wood, Harry H. Corbett, Hugh Griffith, Eric Sykes, Ronnie Barker, Harry Secombe\n\nFacts:\n- The Bargee is a 1964 British comedy film directed by Duncan Wood and starring Harry H. Corbett, Hugh Griffith, Eric Sykes, and Ronnie Barker.\n- Eric Sykes was an English radio, stage, television, and film writer, comedian, actor, and director who was born on 4 May 1923, died on 4 July 2012, and had a performing career spanning more than 50 years.\n- Rhubarb is a 1969 British short film written and directed by Eric Sykes and starring Eric Sykes and Harry Secombe.",
